TAXI-db — licensing overview
Copyright (c) 2026 DarkSwordman999

Commercial use of this project is NOT permitted. It is split into two parts:

1. Code — SQL, Python, shell scripts, GUI, tests and workflows:
   PolyForm Noncommercial License 1.0.0 (full text below).

2. Database and documentation — the compiled trip database in data/chicago/
   (the CSV files and the database dumps attached to GitHub releases),
   docs/ and the images in it:
   Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial 4.0 International (CC BY-NC 4.0),
   https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/legalcode
   This license also covers the database maker's rights (sui generis
   database rights) in the compiled database.

The raw trip records themselves are public data of the City of Chicago (see
the last section). Anyone who needs them for commercial purposes can obtain
them directly from the City of Chicago Data Portal under the City's terms.

For commercial licensing, contact the author via GitHub:
https://github.com/DarkSwordman999

